  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-07-12T09:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 12, 2021, 9:00 am\">July 12, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-239 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 07/12/2021<br /><i>9:00 am - 12:00 pm</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-18c5c87e0009b0345d67/\">Board Meeting</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<p>Due to COVID-19, upcoming Executive Board Meetings are being held via Zoom, unless otherwise noted. Instructions on how to easily join Guild meetings via Zoom (no registration required) will be sent via email one day prior to the meeting. Contact Guild President <a href=\"mailto:msrarch@gmail.com\">Micheal Rudden</a> for additional information.</p>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
